# Release scan waivers for scripts/release/build.py (see docs/release.md).
#
# The release gate fails on a High or Critical finding that has a fix in any
# Sentinel-owned image. A waiver is a reviewed, time-boxed exception:
#
#   # <why the risk is accepted for now>; tracked in #<issue>
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Each entry needs an issue in the comment block above it and an expiry at
# most 90 days ahead; scripts/release/preflight.py refuses anything else, and
# Trivy stops honouring an entry after its date. A blank line ends a block.
#
# There are no waivers.
